# Retornatus derived / ephemeral (canonical truth stays under .retornatus/)
# Ed25519 public keys under .retornatus/keys/*.pub are canonical and must be committed.
# Never commit a private key. It lives in the user config dir or RETORNATUS_SIGNING_KEY.
.retornatus/index/
.retornatus/runtime/
